uage (I Speak Spanish).<br /> ST: DtF, HtR, WtO, MtA<br /> Signature Chars: Crowley (hakalu), Joe The Nuwisha (WtA)<br /> Changelings: be afraid of the Technocracian High Five of Doom","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1754-crowley","name":"Crowley","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1754_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1639"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-03T23:19:53-08:00","id":427480,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"http://sameroomgaming.tumblr.com/post/112639675786/creative-director-of-onyx-path-publishing-reveals\" target=\"_blank\">Rich has said</a> that Dreaming - or at least its Kickstarter - is being worked on for late 2015.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/51-marin","name":"marin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2019"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-04T10:37:28-08:00","id":427814,"title":"","content":"Modernization.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/413818-ctd-reality-check-moderizing-without-risking-banality\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/filedata/fetch?filedataid=1074\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/413818-ctd-reality-check-moderizing-without-risking-banality\"> CtD: Reality Check - Moderizing without risking Banality. - Onyx Path Forums </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/413818-ctd-reality-check-moderizing-without-risking-banality\"> http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/413818-ctd-reality-check-moderizing-without-risking-banality </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> Going a bit backwards with my history project for CtD. Modernization. While most of the Courts and various subfactions and Motleys struggle with modernizing. Grumps want to stick with the old ways like the old farts they are; Childings love the whimzie and the pageantry like a social outcast at a ren-fair. </div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Onyx Path Kickstarters I back.<br /> W20, MtC, CB20, DtD, MtAs20, BotW20, Wraith 20th.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1442-paladindemo","name":"PaladinDemo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1442_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"622"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-04T13:20:51-08:00","id":428062,"title":"","content":"As said by the others, expect the Kickstarter near the end of 2015. Based on the other 20th anniversary core books so far, I'm guessing we'll see the actual book sometime around the end of 2016 or early 2017.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Charlie Cantrell</b><br /> Onyx Path Freelancer <hr />Changeling: The Dreaming 20th Anniversary Edition, Conquering Heroes, Book of Freeholds, Guide to the Night, C20 Players Guide","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/648-pookaknight","name":"PookaKnight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar648_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"690"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-05T17:13:59-08:00","id":429493,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Times\">Well, judging by <a href=\"http://theonyxpath.com/a-shakespeare-quote-that-can-only-mean/\" target=\"_blank\">this recent post.</a><br /> Either it is starting, or they are going into theater.</span></span>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1428,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1428-sicol","user":"Sicol","date":". 03-05-2015, 08:23 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1428-sicol","name":"Sicol","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-05T20:42:51-08:00","id":429704,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Sicol</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/426861-when-do-we-see-the-changling-the-dreaming-20th-book?p=429493#post429493\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Times\">Well, judging by <a href=\"http://theonyxpath.com/a-shakespeare-quote-that-can-only-mean/\" target=\"_blank\">this recent post.</a><br /> Either it is starting, or they are going into theater.</span></span></div> </div> </div> </div>That is awesome. I'm happy they're finally getting to Changeling, even if it's only the announcement of the start of it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://drive.google.com/uc?export=view&amp;id=0B9RzepSqCby3Mi1KUmJ5aWUwRVk\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/805-idpersona","name":"idpersona","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar805_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2117"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-06T22:29:08-08:00","id":431067,"title":"","content":"Well, it means that they finally have a Developer (Congrats, Matt!)<br /> My guess is that, based on the more recent KickStarters, they will develop the book to the point of near-completeness (at least in writing) so that there's a shorter time between the KickStarter and the release of the preview PDF (of course, any content added to the main book itself will always add more time to the production of the PDF too.)<br /> That gives them about 6-9 months to do the KickStarter, and then 3 or 4 months to finish the writing/art direction/lay-out and get us the PDF. Then another 2 months of corrections and the final PDF/PoD. That could take us into April, or May of 2016.<br /> <br /> Of course... then we have the physical production of the Deluxe Edition... depending on how specs go, and production goes, that could take another several months after the final PDF is approved. So I'm going to say Summer of 2016 at the earliest, Fall of 2016 is probably a better bet.<br /> <br /> Of course, things could be more streamlined by then, but that's just my really rough estimate. :-/<br /> <br /> <u>NOTE:</u> <i>I do not have any inside information, and am not affiliated with OPP. These are just my guestimates based on what I recall from involvement and watching other KickStarters.</i>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">- Arthur &quot;Torakhan&quot; Dreese <span style=\"color:silver\"><b>David &quot;Wall-of-Text&quot; Tealdeer</b> - US2012070036\u200b - Grand Rapids, MI</span><br /> <img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/a/img855/1250/jv8k.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><br /> <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/nmeqe3m\" target=\"_blank\">V:tM 20th</a> \u2022 <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/pavtnjj\" target=\"_blank\">Hunters Hunted II</a> \u2022 <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/l3hjgjt\" target=\"_blank\">Anarchs Unbound</a> \u2022 <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/mxyvsy9\" target=\"_blank\">W:tA 20th</a> \u2022 <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/k5qe4j4\" target=\"_blank\">W20 Changing Breeds</a> \u2022 <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/m64m9o5\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted 3rd Edition</a> \u2022 <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/qxkop7m\" target=\"_blank\">M:tA 20th</a> \u2022 <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/nd6kms2\" target=\"_blank\">W20BotW</a></div>","edited":{"userid":780,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/780-torakhan","user":"Torakhan","date":". 03-07-2015, 01:22 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/780-torakhan","name":"Torakhan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar780_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"576"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}